# Public site URL used for metadata, sitemap and Open Graph tags.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://marketplusecompony.com

# Optional: set this once a transactional email / CRM webhook is configured
# for the contact form (see app/api/contact/route.ts). Leave unset for now —
# never commit real credentials to source control.
# CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=

# Required for the "Generate An Ad Visual With AI" section (see
# app/api/generate-image/route.ts and lib/ai-image.ts). Create a key at
# platform.openai.com — this key is server-side only and is never sent to
# the browser. The feature is hidden behind a lead-capture form and a
# per-IP rate limit, but each generation still costs real money, so keep
# this key private and monitor usage on the OpenAI dashboard.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
